# Repo-wide LF in the working copy (text=auto normalizes the index to LF
# anyway). Why forced: Windows autocrlf rewrites endings on re-checkout,
# which silently changes the sha of benchmarks/petclinic/load-test.js —
# the baseline-cache key (scope §10.24). Same class of gotcha the target
# clones dodge with core.autocrlf=false (§10.33). No .bat/.cmd files in
# this repo, so nothing needs CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
